OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch new plan to tackle
OL,4,A'parasite' of violence against women
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) has described violence against
OL,8,Fwomen as "a parasite" in wider society.
OL,10,FThe police have launched a new
OL,11,Fstrategic framework setting out the
OL,12,Fnext phase of its seven-year programme
OL,13,Fto tackle violence against women and
OL,14,Fchildren.
OL,16,FSpeaking at the launch, Det Chief Sup
OL,17,FZoe McKee, head of the PSNI's Public
OL,18,FProtection Branch said "regrettably it
OL,19,Fis almost a parasite in our wider
OL,20,Fsociety. Let's not shy away from that".
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
